ce\' row, define a relevant large number of days into the period filed, and set \'0\' into the price field.','script'),(7214,316,'pjField',2,'title','Set prices for submitting cars by owners. You can charge different price according to the length of time that the car is active (visible) on your listing. To do this add and manage \'period / price\' rows below. If you wish to set a \'free trial\' period then set the number of the days and set \'0\' into the price field. If you do not wish to charge owners for submitting their cars, then leave just one \'period / price\' row, define a relevant large number of days into the period filed, and set \'0\' into the price field.','script'),(7215,316,'pjField',3,'title','Set prices for submitting cars by owners. You can charge different price according to the length of time that the car is active (visible) on your listing. To do this add and manage \'period / price\' rows below. If you wish to set a \'free trial\' period then set the number of the days and set \'0\' into the price field. If you do not wish to charge owners for submitting their cars, then leave just one \'period / price\' row, define a relevant large number of days into the period filed, and set \'0\' into the price field.','script'),(7216,317,'pjField',1,'title','Period','script'),(7217,317,'pjField',2,'title','Period','script'),(7218,317,'pjField',3,'title','Period','script'),(7219,318,'pjField',1,'title','Price','script'),(7220,318,'pjField',2,'title','Price','script'),(7221,318,'pjField',3,'title','Price','script'),(7222,319,'pjField',1,'title','Add period / Price','script'),(7223,319,'pjField',2,'title','Add period / Price','script'),(7224,319,'pjField',3,'title','Add period / Price','script'),(7225,320,'pjField',1,'title','Delete period','script'),(7226,320,'pjField',2,'title','Delete period','script'),(7227,320,'pjField',3,'title','Delete period','script'),(7228,321,'pjField',1,'title','Are you sure that you want to delete this period / price?','script')